  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your eidolon perceive your surroundings as one.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sense Link<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the number of rounds per day that you can use your bond senses class feature, and while using it you add one-half your mythic tier to the bonus you gain on Perception checks. In addition, you may allow your eidolon to use your senses at the same time, and it gains the same bonus when using your senses that you gain when using its senses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
